# URLs the link checker cannot verify anonymously, and must not fail on.

# Creating a security advisory requires being signed in with write access, so
# an anonymous request is redirected to login rather than to the form. The link
# is correct; it is simply not checkable from CI.
https://github.com/kannan19302/UniERP/security/advisories/new

# Shields.io renders badges on demand and rate-limits aggressive checkers.
https://img.shields.io/.*

# Local development URLs from the "Run it locally" section. Nothing is
# listening on a CI runner, by design.
http://localhost:.*
